Synthetic order-event fixtures (decision 0009). Nothing in this directory was received from
Paradex or belongs to an account.

- Every frame here is hand-built from Paradex's published SBE schema (see README.md). Each
  OrderEvent carries a 32-byte `account` field; in every frame it is the made-up bytes a0, a1,
  ... bf, which are not a Starknet account address of the owner or of anyone else.
- The client ids are either ids this library mints in the tests' namespace (computed from the
  test's namespace, account key and start time, see the test) or a random version 4 UUID; the
  order ids, request ids, sequences, timestamps, prices and sizes are made-up inputs.

This marker covers fixtures/paradex/exec/ only. Recorded Paradex frames never go here.
